# Force-include Architecture Decision Records — the user's GLOBAL gitignore
# ignores *.md, but ADRs are durable decision records that MUST ship with the
# repo. The negation below overrides the global rule for docs/adr/.
!docs/adr/
!docs/adr/*.md
!docs/agents/
!docs/agents/*.md

